          ]
        }
      ],
      "trigger": "For two 18-decimal tokens, amount_raw=10**24, pool raw_price=1, fee=.003, input USD price=1e308 and output USD price=1e306 are individually finite. Both calculated USD notionals overflow to infinity.",
      "observed": "The comparison inf < inf is false. plan_conversion returns an accepted route even though output market value/input market value is .00997, below the required .98 ratio.",
